<title>USA: Avert loses Ameritech affiliate pact.</title>
<headline>Avert loses Ameritech affiliate pact.</headline>
<dateline>FORT COLLINS, Colo. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avert Inc said on Wednesday that an affiliate of Ameritech Corp had canceled its contract to provide pre-employment screening information.</p>
<p>Avert said the Ameritech affiliate, Ameritech Information Access LLC, ended the agreement because of a change in business strategy.</p>
<p>The company did not provide details relating to the size of the terminated contract.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
